      "narrative": "Hail dented the roof and bonnet during a storm. The insured wrote: quote, my neighbour said the whole street would be treated as fraud if we all claimed at once, unquote. Assessor photographs show ordinary hail damage."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WM-3204",
      "policy": "WM-P-4442",
      "reported": "2026-02-18",
      "narrative": "Low speed shunt in slow traffic. The account of who was stationary changes between the first call and the written statement, and no third party details were exchanged."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WM-3231",
      "policy": "WM-P-4450",
      "reported": "2026-02-21",
      "narrative": "Kerbing damage to two alloy wheels. The insured cannot say which kerb or when it happened, and the tyre fitter note is dated before the reported incident."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WM-3258",
      "policy": "WM-P-4457",
      "reported": "2026-02-24",
      "narrative": "Passenger window shattered by a falling branch. Glass replaced at an approved fitter, receipt supplied."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WM-3277",
      "policy": "WM-P-4463",
      "reported": "2026-02-26",
      "narrative": "Head on collision on a rural road. Both vehicles written off, air ambulance attended, and a bodyshop has quoted for a courtesy vehicle for eleven weeks."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WM-3290",
